{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116507","id":3305160864,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7FAMCg","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116507","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116507.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116507.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116507","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116507/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116507/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116507/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/1726f8fe003b90fd0c6026e6d4c82819aff2eee6","number":116507,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add soft Gaussian-blurred shadows to StyleBoxFlat","user":{"login":"Samvkes","id":44610150,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NjEwMTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44610150?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes","html_url":"https://github.com/Samvkes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samvkes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13755\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1554\" height=\"869\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-02-19 201106\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/91b366d7-83bf-49b9-ad0e-6b1b483cbc5c\" />\r\n\r\nThis emulates a \"real\" Gaussian falloff by combining multiple \"rings\" of shadow with linear falloff (the image below shows the rings, in the final implementation the rings actually get thinner towards the shadow edge, to get a softer falloff).\r\n<img width=\"374\" height=\"334\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a6e4f57f-ce43-4a3d-a91b-37a094f4b3b7\" />\r\n\r\nThis adds a new toggle menu under \"Shadow\" where the user can pick the amount of shadow rings (it usually needs around 6 to look good) and the shadow spread.\r\n<img width=\"433\" height=\"206\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/129a25e6-d438-4293-b779-b47f9ebde994\" />\r\n\r\nI've done some really basic benchmarking: in a scene with hundreds of constantly rescaling Panels, if I want to stay at 60fps I can either have ~400 regular shadow styleboxes, or ~200 gaussian shadow styleboxes (each with 8 rings). The performance-hit seems to almost entirely be caused by the additional draw commands, so I'm not sure if there's an easy way to make this much faster.\r\n\r\nThx to @sockeye-d for feedback, fine-tuning of the shadow shape, and implementation of the error-function!","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","descripti